          },
          {
            "id": "epistle-line-27",
            "text": "игланѣ ѹха проити, так и грѣшником въ црⷭтво нбⷭноє внїити.",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              102,
              1080,
              956,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-iv-111-image-20261126",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 59,
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "epistle-line-28",
            "text": "Легчайше бꙋдеⷮ Содомꙋ и Гоморꙋ въ дн҃ь сꙋдный, нежли тым лю-",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              102,
              1115,
              956,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-iv-111-image-20261126",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 60,
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "epistle-line-29",
            "text": "дем, што не вѣрꙋют писанїю ст҃мꙋ правдивомꙋ. Прокляти соꙋт на",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              102,
              1150,
              956,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-iv-111-image-20261126",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 61,
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "epistle-line-30",
            "text": "вѣки! Не сп҃сеⷮ сѧ град или вес, иж не пропишеⷮ єпистолїя сєя со",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              102,
              1185,
              956,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-iv-111-image-20261126",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 64,
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "epistle-line-31",
            "text": "страхом бж҃їим и трепетом. иж бы мовили: „лжа єⷭ а не правда“,",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              102,
              1221,
              956,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-iv-111-image-20261126",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 62,
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "epistle-line-32",
            "text": "прокляти сꙋт. Ѡ горе чл҃кꙋ томꙋ, иж не вѣрит и ни слꙋхает писма",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              102,
              1256,
              956,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-iv-111-image-20261126",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 63,
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "epistle-line-33",
            "text": "ст҃го. Ѡ горе чл҃кꙋ томꙋ, иж попа ѹкаряет или ѡклеветает, или",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              102,
              1291,
              956,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-iv-111-image-20261126",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 61,
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "epistle-line-34",
            "text": "черноризца или дїакона! Тїи бо въходят въ цр҃ков бж҃їю и мо-",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              102,
              1326,
              956,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
